  41:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/BasicMathFunctions/arm_negate_q7.c ****  * @brief  Negates the elements of a Q7 vector.
  42:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/BasicMathFunctions/arm_negate_q7.c ****  * @param[in]  *pSrc points to the input vector
